Toon.DotNet
    https://github.com/CharlesHunt/ToonDotNet
    https://www.nuget.org/packages/Toon.DotNet
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 ToonFormat Contributors

    Consumed as a NuGet package. Encodes and decodes the structured output every agent in this
    repository reads and writes.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TOON (Token-Oriented Object Notation) - the format specification
    https://github.com/toon-format/toon
    MIT License

    The open specification the notation above implements. Not a dependency; listed because this
    repository's prompts teach the format and a reader may want the authoritative definition.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
dragonmind-knowledge
    https://github.com/nathangeranis/dragonmind-knowledge
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 nathangeranis

    Consumed as a git submodule at knowledge/, pinned to the tag v0.1.0. Provides the scoped memory
    the agents here read and write: semantic retrieval over pgvector, a fact graph in Apache AGE,
    and the anti-corruption-layer facade in front of both.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Microsoft.Extensions.AI
    https://github.com/dotnet/extensions
    MIT License, Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors

    Consumed as NuGet packages. Supplies the IChatClient abstraction every agent consumes, and the
    OpenAI-compatible provider the composition root uses when a real model is configured.

